{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/47145c560b2cfbae3059ccb55c621903.avif?t=1768411737\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the new arrival to the island, you're here to meet eligible <strong>bachelorx pads</strong> and find the love of your life! Enjoy a one-of-a-kind story as you navigate a bizarre dating adventure amongst a unique set of structures.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Uncover hidden secrets!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of biomes across an island, jam-packed with goodies! Search through a somber forest, climb up a snowy mountain, or just lay in a flowery field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.poster.avif?t=1768411737\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.webm?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/95d108409ba2f5183c6e5a59ffbd5b11.mp4?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic building movement!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw away your dreams of home ownership! Instead, become the house! Embrace the freeing sensation of flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.poster.avif?t=1768411737\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.webm?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/90d75a6869d219879631ecb3387431e3.mp4?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Go on a date!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking to shack up? Choose between Millie (a windmill who might step on you if you ask nicely) or Tenet (who's just a himbo tent). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.poster.avif?t=1768411737\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.webm?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/eef9887ef1724ffee174493a5fdd544a.mp4?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Or go fishing instead?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They say there\u2019s plenty of fish in the sea\u2026 but you won\u2019t find any around here. We replaced all the fish with cars because it just made more sense.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.poster.avif?t=1768411737\" width=590 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2666920/extras/1c7f7d4ede14674c6b4939c070515286.webm?t=1768411737\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: